TITLE FlahaX struvite reference mixture
PHASES
Struvite
    MgNH4PO4:6H2O = Mg+2 + NH4+ + PO4-3 + 6H2O
    -log_k -13.26
SOLUTION 1
    temp 25
    pH 8.5
    units mmol/kgw
    Mg 1
    N(-3) 1 as NH4
    P 1 as H2PO4
    Na 1
    Cl 3
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file struvite_probe.sel
    -reset false
    -pH true
    -ionic_strength true
    -activities Mg+2 NH4+ PO4-3
    -si Struvite
END
